 116:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jccolor.c **** 
 117:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jccolor.c **** 
 118:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jccolor.c **** /*
 119:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jccolor.c ****  * Convert some rows of samples to the JPEG colorspace.
 120:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jccolor.c ****  *
 121:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jccolor.c ****  * Note that we change from the application's interleaved-pixel format
ARM GAS  /tmp/ccxwFal8.s 			page 6


 122:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jccolor.c ****  * to our internal noninterleaved, one-plane-per-component format.
 123:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jccolor.c ****  * The input buffer is therefore three times as wide as the output buffer.
 124:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jccolor.c ****  *
 125:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jccolor.c ****  * A starting row offset is provided only for the output buffer.  The caller
